{
    "title": "Laundryheap: On-Demand Laundry",
    "description": "Laundry, we get it. Clothes wash services, dry cleaning, ironing, and duvet cleaning. All in one place.\r\n \r\nShort on time but still want to remain fresh? No need to worry, with free collection & delivery in less than 24 hours, you\u2019ll have clean laundry and peace of mind, so that you can spend more time on the things that you love.\r\n\r\nServices\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wash\r\n\u2022 Wash & Iron\r\n\u2022 Ironing\r\n\u2022 Dry Cleaning\r\n\u2022 Duvets & Bulky Items*\r\n\r\nHow It Works\r\n\r\n1) Schedule a collection time\r\n2) Pack your laundry\r\n3) Track our partner driver\r\n4) Delivery in 24 hours with real-time order tracking\r\n\r\nLocation Availability\r\n\r\n\u2022 United Kingdom - London, Manchester, Birmingham, Coventry\r\n\u2022 United States - New York City, Jersey City, Boston, Chicago, Los Angeles, San Francisco, San Jose, Dallas, Washington D.C, Miami\r\n\u2022 Ireland - Dublin\r\n\u2022 Netherlands - Amsterdam, Rotterdam, The Hague\r\n\u2022 France - Paris\r\n\u2022 Denmark - Copenhagen\r\n\u2022 United Arab Emirates - Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah\r\n\u2022 Saudi Arabia - Riyadh, Jeddah\r\n\u2022 Qatar - Doha\r\n\u2022 Kuwait - Kuwait City\r\n\u2022 Bahrain - Manama\r\n\u2022 Singapore - Singapore\r\n\u2022 Peru - Lima\r\n\r\nFrequently Asked Questions\r\n\r\n\u2022 How does Laundryheap work?\r\nSimply select the required services and choose the dates for collection & delivery, leaving any additional instructions for the driver. Following this, we\u2019ll take care of everything else with the help of our partner cleaning facilities.\r\n\r\n\u2022 What is the turnaround time?\r\nFor standard laundry and dry cleaning services, we have a monthly average of collecting and delivering within 24 hours. Note* duvet and bulky items may require additional time. We will always do our best to let you know in advance if you have included items that will require a longer processing time, or if there are any delivery changes to your order.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Where do you clean my clothes?\r\nAfter your items are collected by our driver, they are taken to one of our local partner facilities. Each order is processed separately - Laundry orders are weighed and cleaned, while all other services are individually itemized and processed.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Can I provide my own detergent?\r\nAt this time, we do not offer the option for customers to provide their own laundry detergent, but please let us know if you are allergic to a certain type so we can make sure to avoid it.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Do you wash my clothes with other people\u2019s clothes?\r\nAbsolutely not. Each order is washed separately so no need to worry about that. Your clothes are safe with us!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Laundry, we get it. Clothes wash services, dry cleaning, ironing, and duvet cleaning. All in one place.<br> <br>Short on time but still want to remain fresh? No need to worry, with free collection &amp; delivery in less than 24 hours, you\u2019ll have clean laundry and peace of mind, so that you can spend more time on the things that you love.<br><br>Services<br><br>\u2022 Wash<br>\u2022 Wash &amp; Iron<br>\u2022 Ironing<br>\u2022 Dry Cleaning<br>\u2022 Duvets &amp; Bulky Items*<br><br>How It Works<br><br>1) Schedule a collection time<br>2) Pack your laundry<br>3) Track our partner driver<br>4) Delivery in 24 hours with real-time order tracking<br><br>Location Availability<br><br>\u2022 United Kingdom - London, Manchester, Birmingham, Coventry<br>\u2022 United States - New York City, Jersey City, Boston, Chicago, Los Angeles, San Francisco, San Jose, Dallas, Washington D.C, Miami<br>\u2022 Ireland - Dublin<br>\u2022 Netherlands - Amsterdam, Rotterdam, The Hague<br>\u2022 France - Paris<br>\u2022 Denmark - Copenhagen<br>\u2022 United Arab Emirates - Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah<br>\u2022 Saudi Arabia - Riyadh, Jeddah<br>\u2022 Qatar - Doha<br>\u2022 Kuwait - Kuwait City<br>\u2022 Bahrain - Manama<br>\u2022 Singapore - Singapore<br>\u2022 Peru - Lima<br><br>Frequently Asked Questions<br><br>\u2022 How does Laundryheap work?<br>Simply select the required services and choose the dates for collection &amp; delivery, leaving any additional instructions for the driver. Following this, we\u2019ll take care of everything else with the help of our partner cleaning facilities.<br><br>\u2022 What is the turnaround time?<br>For standard laundry and dry cleaning services, we have a monthly average of collecting and delivering within 24 hours. Note* duvet and bulky items may require additional time. We will always do our best to let you know in advance if you have included items that will require a longer processing time, or if there are any delivery changes to your order.<br><br>\u2022 Where do you clean my clothes?<br>After your items are collected by our driver, they are taken to one of our local partner facilities. Each order is processed separately - Laundry orders are weighed and cleaned, while all other services are individually itemized and processed.<br><br>\u2022 Can I provide my own detergent?<br>At this time, we do not offer the option for customers to provide their own laundry detergent, but please let us know if you are allergic to a certain type so we can make sure to avoid it.<br><br>\u2022 Do you wash my clothes with other people\u2019s clothes?<br>Absolutely not. Each order is washed separately so no need to worry about that. Your clothes are safe with us!",
